`benchmark.meta description: Repeated reserved scalar Map insertion at 80,000 entries.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: compile-timing,allocator

/core

. count = 80000 as Size
. checksum = 0u64
for repetition in 0 .. < 5
    . map = Map'U64'U64(count)
    for index in 0 .. < count
        map[index as U64] = (index + repetition) as U64
    checksum += (map.length as U64) + map[(count - 1) as U64]!

-- "bench-result map/put-uniform-scalar-80000-reserved checksum=$checksum"
